+| obligation map | `cf331f312938e04436a60d1dc49b5a1f6f60b03f3283415439a7c175e9812048` |
+| trust inventory | `6b7f2b23b0620aa595e7f7fab3946aafc66e8299dcc9048b64a187a695bf6df0` |
+
